# The cmux harness's B3 configuration (hypotheses.md, Appendix B; WL7), rendered by
# bench/competitors/competitors.py: the cases configuration (Appendix B's line, with Any() last)
# with the 60 s timer. One argument and its value per line.
# The listener; its backlog is net.core.somaxconn (net/sock_linux.go at go1.27.1; Appendix B).
-port @PORT@
# SetReadTimeout at 60 s (section 1).
-timer-s @TIMER_S@
# Any() last, as in Appendix B's line; within the window's 30 s no silent connection reaches it.
-fallback
-cert @REPO@/tests/fixtures/tls/test-cert.pem
-key @REPO@/tests/fixtures/tls/test-key.pem
